{"id": "EUVD-2026-102484", "enisaUuid": "1bcba52a-63ad-3ab8-8fe3-16908d15cc81", "description": "JuggleIM im-server through 1.8.16 contains a weak password hashing vulnerability that stores admin console passwords as unsalted SHA-1 digests via tools.SHA1 in services/accountservice.go. Attackers who obtain the accounts table through database access or backups can crack console passwords using precomputed tables or GPU brute force.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T17:08:47", "baseScore": 8.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/juggleim-im-server-default-admin-credential", "https://github.com/juggleim/imserver-console/blob/v1.0.10/services/accountservice.go#L95", "https://github.com/juggleim/im-server/blob/v1.8.16/sql/imserver.sql#L3-L15", "https://github.com/juggleim/im-server", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/juggleim-im-server-through-1.8.16-weak-password-hashing-via-unsalted-sha-1"], "aliases": ["GHSA-53gf-xhq2-c3j8", "CVE-2026-111330"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6b302564-2c7a-3ada-aae7-5e1c96337a1b", "product": {"name": "JuggleIM", "vendor": {"name": "juggleim"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.8.16"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0967337e-3371-3c9b-92fe-d2cbfab79f2a", "vendor": {"name": "juggleim"}}], "isExploited": false}